# Scratch artifacts from local prototype verification — not part of the deliverable.
# These are throwaway scripts/servers/screenshots created while checking the
# prototype; they should never be committed.
_*.js
_*.json
_*.patch
_*.diff
.playwright-mcp/
shot-*.png
# Agents drop screenshots at the repo root by accident; three were committed in one
# session. Anchored to the root so every tracked PNG under docs/ and src/ is unaffected.
/*.png
Architecture Review*
stitch_*

# Agent scratch. .claude/ also holds a nested git worktree, so committing it
# would nest a duplicate of the repo inside itself. .agents/ itself is tracked
# (the skills); only the teamwork run folders are throwaway.
.claude/
*-agy-*.txt
.agents/teamwork/
.scratch/


# The impeccable skill's working directory. The text record — the surface
# brief, the design sidecar, the critique and the finish review — is tracked
# deliberately; the capture PNGs are throwaway evidence, like shot-*.png.
.impeccable/*.png
.impeccable/review/*.png

# ERD generator intermediate (regenerated from the database)
docs/erd/meta.json

# Dev mail drop (DropFolderEmailSender writes activation/reset mail here)
mail-drop/

# .NET build artifacts and IDE state
.vs/
bin/
obj/
src/WebMVC/WebMVC.csproj.user
*.user

# Graphify output. Ignored whole, not partly: it is a local cache rebuilt from
# this source tree by `python -m graphify update .` (AST-only, zero API cost),
# and it is 23 MB of single-line JSON plus ~230 MB of dated 2026-* snapshots and
# 7 MB of cache. Tracking it produced 79 "chore(graph): rebuild" commits and the
# merge conflicts in its history. A fresh clone rebuilds it in one command.
graphify-out/

# Local secrets & environment configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Some tooling writes the key file as `env` (no dot); it holds the same live keys
# as .env and must never be committed. Tracked template: .env.example only.
/env

# Runtime uploads and agent scratch
App_Data/
scratch/
logs/
.superpowers/
.gemini/
__pycache__/
*.pyc



# .NET test output (trx logs, not source)
test-results/
*.trx
TestResults/
